  "content": "<p><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://blay09.net/files/brand/requires_balm.png\" alt=\"需要Balm前置\" width=\"217\" height=\"51\"> </a> <img src=\"https://blay09.net/files/brand/spacer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"51\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;<a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/BlayTheNinth\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/VAfZ2Nau6j\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://blay09.net/files/brand/discord.png\" alt=\"加入我们的Discord\" width=\"51\" height=\"51\"> </a> <img src=\"https://blay09.net/files/brand/spacer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"51\"></p><p>Ex Compressum是<a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ex-nihilo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ex Nihilo</a>的一个附属模组，提供了一系列工具，以平衡的方式减少空岛生存中最初的繁琐工作。</p><p>在Minecraft 1.10.2版本中，它同时支持<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ex-nihilo-omnia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ex Nihilo Omnia</a>和<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ex-nihilo-adscensio\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ex Nihilo Adscensio</a>。</p><p>在Minecraft 1.12版本中，它支持<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ex-nihilo-creatio\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ex Nihilo: Creatio</a>。</p><p>在Minecraft 1.20.1版本中，它支持<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exnihilosequentia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ex Nihilo: Sequentia</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-deorum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ex Deorum</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabricae-ex-nihilo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabricae Ex Nihilo</a>。</p><p>在Minecraft 1.21版本中，它支持<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exnihilosequentia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ex Nihilo: Sequentia</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-deorum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ex Deorum</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmods.twelveiterations.com%252fsponsor\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/sponsor.png\" alt=\"支持本项目\" width=\"830\" height=\"130\"> </a></p><p><strong>功能特性</strong></p><ul>  \n<li>压缩锤：用于将压缩方块破碎成九个碎块版本（例如，压缩砾石→9个沙子）</li>  \n<li>压缩曲柄：速度是普通曲柄的四倍，但耐久度仅为两倍</li>  \n<li>重型筛子：可直接筛分压缩方块，但效率略有损失</li>  \n<li>自动压缩机：自动将物品压缩成方块（例如，碎矿石→矿石砾石）</li>  \n<li>自动筛子和自动锤</li>  \n<li>木制坩埚：从植物中提取水源，作为雨水收集的替代方案</li>  \n<li>动物诱饵：放置后可召唤牛、猪、鸡、羊、豹猫和狼，即使在非自然生物群系中也能生成</li>  \n</ul><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/33/209/runeinabox.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"534\" height=\"357\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
